# 复制为 voice/.env 并填写（.env 已被 .gitignore 忽略，切勿提交真实 key）
# 阿里云百炼 / DashScope API Key：https://bailian.console.aliyun.com/ → API-KEY
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=

# 可选：国际站请改为 https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1 和 wss://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api-ws/v1/inference
# DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
# DASHSCOPE_WS_URL=wss://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api-ws/v1/inference
# DEEPSUCK_LLM_MODEL=qwen-plus
# DEEPSUCK_ASR_MODEL=paraformer-realtime-v2
# DEEPSUCK_TTS_MODEL=cosyvoice-v3-flash
# 设计音色（python -m voice.design_voice wang 生成，只在你自己的账号里可用）
# DEEPSUCK_VOICE_WANG=cosyvoice-v3.5-flash-vd-wangdb-xxxxxxxx
# DEEPSUCK_VOICE_WANG_MODEL=cosyvoice-v3.5-flash
# DEEPSUCK_VOICE_WANG_INSTRUCTION=0
# #11 新人设（id 暂按 chen / zheng，定稿以 personas.json 为准）。不设时用系统音色：小陈妈妈 longanli_v3，郑老板 longsanshu_v3。
# 下面两个 ID 由项目语音账号创建，只在该账号可用；换账号用 python -m voice.design_voice chen 重新创建。
# DEEPSUCK_VOICE_CHEN=cosyvoice-v3.5-flash-vd-chenc-153ea028246f4b7896c05a82c8dbed3c
# DEEPSUCK_VOICE_ZHENG=cosyvoice-v3.5-flash-vd-zhengb-45762dff9b364eedb3b63cf533bb4714   # B 方案，默认不设
